<section class="section" id="why-fujiiryoki">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">The Case for Fujiiryoki</span>
      <h2>Why Serious Buyers Consider <span class="accent-u">Fujiiryoki</span></h2>
      <p>Fujiiryoki earns its place on premium buyers&rsquo; shortlists for specific, substantive reasons &mdash; not marketing claims.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-grid">
