      <div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg></div><h3>Human Hand-Inspired Massage Feel</h3><p>Fujiiryoki is often chosen by buyers who prefer a controlled, human hand-inspired massage feel rather than a chair that simply feels intense. Many buyers notice a more refined, natural quality when comparing Fujiiryoki in person.</p></div>
      <div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.4 10.5l4.77-8.26C13.47 2.09 12.75 2 12 2c-2.4 0-4.6.85-6.32 2.25L9.4 10.5zm12.28 2.24H12.37l-2.68 4.63 4.77 8.26c2.6-.86 4.75-2.75 6.01-5.12L21.68 12.74zm-12.3.01L6.34 10H2.04C2.01 10.33 2 10.66 2 11c0 3.51 1.81 6.59 4.54 8.38L9.38 12.75zM20.45 7.63A9.97 9.97 0 0015.2 4.1l-3.04 5.25h6.81a9.99 9.99 0 001.48-1.72z"/></svg></div><h3>AI-Guided Body Scanning</h3><p>The Cyber Relax Ai uses AI-guided body scanning to adapt massage paths in real time to your unique spinal curve and shoulder width &mdash; not a fixed program applied uniformly to everyone.</p></div>
      <div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/></svg></div><h3>Premium Build Quality</h3><p>Materials, mechanisms, and upholstery are selected for long-term durability and premium tactile feel. Fujiiryoki chairs are designed to be used daily for years.</p></div>
      <div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2.05v2.02c3.95.49 7 3.85 7 7.93 0 3.21-1.81 6-4.72 7.72L13 17v5h5l-1.22-1.22C19.91 19.07 22 15.76 22 12c0-5.18-3.95-9.45-9-9.95zM11 2.05C5.95 2.55 2 6.82 2 12c0 3.76 2.09 7.07 5.22 8.78L6 22h5v-5l-2.28 2.28C7.81 18 6 15.21 6 12c0-4.08 3.05-7.44 7-7.93V2.05z"/></svg></div><h3>Refined Comfort Profile</h3><p>Fujiiryoki chairs deliver a controlled, consistent massage feel. Not aggressive. Not overwhelming. Precisely calibrated &mdash; the kind of quality that improves with repeated daily use rather than fatiguing it.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

