<section class="section section-alt" id="faq">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label">Frequently Asked</span>
      <h2>Fujiiryoki Massage Chair <span class="accent-u">FAQ</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--fji-border)">
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>What is the best Fujiiryoki massage chair?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>The best Fujiiryoki massage chair depends on your body fit, preferred massage position, desired technology level, and budget. Cyber Relax Ai is best for buyers who want AI technology and a more personalized massage experience. Cyber Relax Elite is a strong fit for shoppers who want the core Cyber Relax feel. MR-6000 Calm Plus is the most accessible Fujiiryoki option, while Cyber Relax Pro is the flagship performance model if available.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Is Fujiiryoki a Japanese massage chair brand?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes, Fujiiryoki is known for Japanese massage chair heritage and a more refined approach to massage technology. Buyers often compare Fujiiryoki when they want precision, long-term comfort, and a human hand-inspired massage feel rather than the most aggressive chair possible.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between Cyber Relax Ai and Cyber Relax Elite?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Cyber Relax Ai is positioned for buyers who want AI massage features, body scanning, and a more personalized massage experience. Cyber Relax Elite is a strong option for shoppers who want the Cyber Relax massage chair experience with premium comfort and refined daily use.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Does Fujiiryoki offer foot and calf massage?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Fujiiryoki models may include foot and calf massage, air massage, and foot rollers depending on the chair. Because comfort varies by height, leg length, and preferred intensity, we recommend testing the models in person before choosing.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Is Fujiiryoki good for full body massage?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Fujiiryoki chairs are designed to deliver a premium full body massage chair experience, but the right model depends on your body shape, height, shoulder fit, leg fit, and preferred massage position. A showroom trial is the best way to confirm fit.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Can a Fujiiryoki massage chair help with muscle fatigue?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Many buyers compare Fujiiryoki chairs for relaxation after long workdays, travel, standing, or general muscle fatigue. A massage chair should not be treated as medical care or a treatment for a health condition. If you have medical concerns, consult a qualified healthcare professional before purchasing.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Is it spelled Fujiiryoki or Fujiryoki?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>The correct spelling is Fujiiryoki. Some shoppers search for &ldquo;Fujiryoki&rdquo; or &ldquo;Fuji massage chair,&rdquo; but the brand name is Fujiiryoki. If you are comparing Fujiiryoki massage chairs, our showroom team can help you identify the right model and avoid confusion with other Japanese or premium massage chair brands.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Should I buy Fujiiryoki online or try it in a showroom?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>For a premium massage chair, we strongly recommend trying Fujiiryoki in person. Reviews and specifications are useful, but they cannot fully show how the chair fits your body, how the foot rollers feel, or whether the massage position is comfortable for long-term use. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your showroom visit here.</a></p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Fujiiryoki massage chairs in person?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries Fujiiryoki models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and our Pleasanton location at Stoneridge Shopping Center. We strongly recommend trying Fujiiryoki in person before purchasing. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your visit here.</a></p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="fujiFaq(this)"><h3>Where can I buy authentic Fujiiryoki massage chairs?</h3><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="faq-a"><p>House of Massage Chairs is an authorized Fujiiryoki dealer with showrooms in San Jose and Pleasanton, CA. Buying from an authorized specialist ensures genuine Fujiiryoki products, valid manufacturer warranties, professional white-glove delivery and setup, and specialist post-purchase support.</p></div></div>
